"title": "laana",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "laana",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><b>Kumlaani</b> mtu ni kinyume cha kumbariki <a href=\"#t16\">mtu</a>. Unapombariki mtu unatamani kitu kizuri kitendeke kwa mtu unayembariki. Unapowalaani unatamani kitu kibaya kiwafanyikie. Watu <b>waliamini</b> kwamba laana ingekuja kuwa kweli. Ikiwa mtu aliwalaani waliogopa sana.</p><p>Mungu anapomlaani mtu kitu kibaya ambacho Mungu anasema kitatokea hakika kitatokea. Mungu anawalaani watu ili kuwaadhibu. Mungu <b>aliwaambia</b> Waisraeli kwamba ikiwa wangemtii, angewabariki. Ikiwa hawangemtii Mungu angewalaani.</p>",
